abstract: >-
  A CPU-reproducible research artifact for authority-optimal diagnosis of
  hidden embodied semantic interfaces. It distinguishes full hidden-identity
  recovery from the minimum evidence required to authorize one exact,
  implementation/evidence/dependency-bound repair, and includes Lean 4
  structural stopping theorems.
keywords:
  - embodied intelligence
  - robot learning
  - semantic interfaces
  - active diagnosis
  - formal methods
  - reproducibility
